Filename: pmcp.readme                 last updated 17 April 1997

The files pmcp.dat and pmcp.cod contain the PMCP tracer concentration
and the quality control flags, respectively. The data is still 
restricted and only to be used by the ETEX and ATMES participants.
When making reference to the data, please always quote the version number 
(now etex2_v1.1.970411). A detailed description of the data is in 
preparation in will be send to you later. 

